  "acceptance_met": [
    "Bounded runnable recipes distinguish admission, acknowledgment, application delivery, stored commit, failure and ambiguity. Producer cancellation retains flush/close results separately; no blind fresh resend after lost receipt.",
    "Actual Markdown one-record capped poll/pause/process/commit recipe commits only returned next_offsets with leader epoch; explains ownership loss, retained/revoked pending state, delivered vs fetch cursor, external idempotency and restart from stored group offsets.",
    "EOS example now copies one capped batch, retries coordinator startup before staging, retries the same transaction commit without re-sending data, aborts pre-commit/explicit abort-required failures within a deadline, stops fatal fencing, and leaves/closes. Ambiguous commit never switches to abort.",
    "Corrected stale migration/gaps/feature rows for already-repaired seek/reset/abort-marker behavior and bounded gzip/Snappy/LZ4 expansion; cites source-pinned/mock evidence without claiming live universal equivalence."
  ],
